WEBVTT

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Ana: Welcome to the loyalty design review. Our summary: Customers earn a stamp for each 10 pounds spent, and a free loaf at ten stamps.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Ana: Stamps are recorded through the app, with a paper card as a fallback.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Chris: Free loaves expire after 60 days.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:16.000
Ana: The programme needs a privacy notice before launch.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:38.000
Chris: Decision: Paper cards stay available for at least a year.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:56.000
Ana: Action: Draft the privacy notice. Please confirm by Friday.

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:11.000
Ana: Action: Test the stamp redemption at the till. Please confirm by Friday.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:26.000
Chris: Thanks. Summary sent after the call.
